    "title": "Who is Taylor Frankie Paul? Facts about ABC's newest 'Bachelorette' lead",
    "text": "Sept. 10, 2025, 2:31 p.m. ETABC's long-running series \"The Bachelorette\" just got a bit more interesting.The network announced Sept. 10 that a \"Secret Lives of Mormon Wives\" stand-out will be the surprising leading lady in the upcoming season 22 of \"The Bachelorette.\"The official ABC announcement followed speculation and discussion about the unprecedented selection on TikTok − a choice which is already rocking Bachelor Nation.The crossover is a natural one as the Hulu reality show \"Mormon Wives,\" following a friend group of Mormon women, has been taking over ABC reality programs, where \"The Bachelorette\" airs. Both Hulu and ABC are owned by parent company Disney.Here's what to know.Watch live TV on FuboWho is the next Bachelorette 2025?\"The Secret Lives of Mormon Wives\" star Taylor Frankie Paul will appear as the titular role in \"The Bachelorette\" season 22.In an interview on Alex Cooper's \"Call Her Daddy\" podcast, Paul said being \"The Bachelorette\" is \"surreal.\"\"It has not hit me,\" Paul said. \"Like right now in this moment, I'm just thinking about it and it's like, 'It's not real. It's not real.' It's not going to be until, I think, the limo's pulling up.\"Who is Taylor Frankie Paul?Paul is a Utah-based TikTok influencer who went viral in 2022 after revealing that she and her then-husband, Tate Paul, had been \"soft-swinging\" with other Mormon couples. Hulu's hit reality show \"Mormon Wives\" started on Hulu in 2024, focusing on Taylor and her influencer friends − dubbed \"MomTok\" − dealing with the \"soft-swinging\" scandal fallout.Taylor and Tate divorced in 2022. In the Hulu reality series, Taylor is together with boyfriend and father of her third child, Dakota Mortensen, with whom she has since separated.The new \"Bachelorette\" will debut in 2026. Paul, a single mother of three, will continue with \"Mormon Wives,\" which returns with season 3 dropping Nov. 13.Paul is a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. However, she told Cooper she isn't restricting her \"Bachelorette\" dating pool to Mormon men.\"I'd be open to Mormons. I still am obviously 'cause I'm Mormon, but he doesn't have to be,\" she said.Taylor Frankie Paul ageBorn on May 23, 1994, Paul is 31 years old.Taylor Frankie Paul kidsPaul has three kids. She shares her daughter, Indy, and son, Ocean, with ex-husband Tate Paul. Her third child, son Ever True, is shared with her ex-boyfriend Dakota Mortensen.When does 'The Bachelorette' start?Season 22 of \"The Bachelorette\" starring Taylor Frankie Paul is expected to premiere in 2026, ABC confirmed.",
